# .cursorrules - Context Optimization Protocol

rules:
  - Keep all source files under 150 lines of code.
  - If a file exceeds 150 lines, modularize it into smaller sub-modules.
  - Never rewrite entire files; return targeted diffs or specific functions.
  - Do not create nested Git repositories or submodules.
  - Store plain CSS modularly; avoid heavy inline frameworks.
  - Use relative paths within subfolders under `/apps/` to maintain Cloudflare compatibility.
